  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"content-panel studio-page\">\n                    <section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Performance investigation</p>\n                            <h2>Battery consumption issue? Measure, understand, fix</h2>\n                            <p>With Greenspector Studio, investigation is fast: run reliable measurements,\n                                identify problematic features, then fix with a prioritised\n                                action plan.</p>\n                            <p>Your profiling tool is powerful but time-consuming. Greenspector Studio helps you\n                                know exactly what to look for and where to focus your efforts.</p>\n                            <p>At each release, keep battery, CPU, RAM and data under control to extend\n                                device lifespan and reduce costs.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Energie-r66sueixesun55ua1ve1nr88ou4vnu2g402pfmteig_d0f89802.png\" alt=\"Energy consumption curve during a journey step\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Battery measurement</p>\n                        <h2>Battery consumption, precisely for each feature</h2>\n                        <p>Greenspector Studio measures battery discharge throughout the user journey, with\n                            fine granularity (down to 200 ms). <strong>You quickly identify\n                                overconsumption hotspots.</strong></p>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/TestBench_FR-r5ydm7qvcdeudu7oxaf6kf2bj6mz7xk1xvwrescvy0_c76a775e.png\" alt=\"Device selection on the Greenspector Test Bench\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Field conditions</p>\n                            <h2>SaaS test conditions close to real life</h2>\n                            <p>Select the device and network connection suited to your context (Wi-Fi, cellular,\n                                consumer devices or business fleets, with or without MDM/EMM).</p>\n                            <p>You get <strong>a diagnosis as close as possible to field usage</strong>, and can\n                                trigger tests directly from your CI/CD.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"../devgreenops/\">Learn more about continuous integration</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/ScriptGDSL-rnqpg1fgul47nbs0d4uarck0is9nkrfa3werw2g51y_63db4caf.png\" alt=\"GDSL script for automated test orchestration\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Automation</p>\n                        <h2>Automate the test you want</h2>\n                        <p>GDSL automation capabilities allow you to<strong>assess software in\n                                different situations</strong>: varying parameters (brightness, network\n                            interfaces), device selection and execution context choice.</p>\n                        <p>Run varied campaigns to understand the exact conditions in which\n                            defects appear.</p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Test reports</p>\n                        <h2>Analyse reports and screenshots</h2>\n                        <p>An error or crash? Access detailed reports, screenshots and\n                            context information to understand exactly what happened.</p>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Rapport-de-test-r65fjt46kzkbzzjefskj8khmekvxjj1ssknlza0xq0_82b93389.png\" alt=\"Successful test report in Greenspector Studio\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Hardware control</p>\n                            <h2>Keep hardware pressure under control</h2>\n                            <p>Why risk an energy bug in production? Validate before each\n                                release and track trends over time.</p>\n                            <p>By controlling hardware pressure, you extend the lifespan of your\n                                devices and achieve <strong>substantial savings for budget and\n                                    the environment.</strong></p>\n                            <p class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-gs-primary\" href=\"../../contact/\">Request a\n                                        free demo</a></p>\n</div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/evolution-r41o1fvo92cqjsiy7yt7o2e2r6pln13h7djzozv2d4_4627dddb.png\" alt=\"Indicator trends over time\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading standards</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised for its environmental efficiency.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>Continuous innovation driven by research and field feedback.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Standards compatibility</h3>\n                                <p>LCA (ISO 14040), Green Software Foundation SCI, ADEME RCP and related references.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio</h2>\n                        <p>To combine environmental responsibility, user satisfaction and application\n                            performance.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_regionbretagne_b8829f76.jpg\" alt=\"Région Bretagne logo\"></figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>"
